title: EmptySpaceSearch
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mário
    family-names: Antunes
    email: mario.antunes@ua.pt
    affiliation: University of Aveiro
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6504-9441'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/mariolpantunes/ess'
url: 'https://mariolpantunes.github.io/ess/'
abstract: >-
  Empty Space Search — places points in the under-explored regions of an
  existing sample by relaxing them under repulsion and an optional attraction
  toward positions predicted to be valuable, measured in toroidal L1 on the
  unit torus. Attractiveness models are pluggable and selected by
  cross-validation on the points already evaluated.
keywords:
  - space-filling-design
  - sampling
  - torus
  - low-discrepancy
  - initialization
  - design-of-experiments
